@startuml
title Teaching Output Export
actor User
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Export API" as API
participant "Output Service" as Output
participant "Safety Service" as Safety
participant Renderer
participant "Object Storage" as Storage
database PostgreSQL as DB
User -> UI: Export format + audience
UI -> API: POST /teaching-outputs/{id}/exports
API -> Output: authorise exact output/version
Output -> DB: lifecycle + current safety review
API -> Safety: validate audience/release
Safety --> API: allowed or fail closed
API -> Renderer: render selected version
Renderer --> API: bytes, filename, media type
API -> Storage: store versioned object
Storage --> API: object key/version
API -> DB: export_job + storage_object + audit
API --> UI: download path
UI -> API: GET export download
API -> Output: re-authorise
API -> Storage: stream bytes
@enduml
